The Drive reported the details.

81
00:03:02,859 --> 00:03:05,214
A five point five liter V8 with

82
00:03:05,214 --> 00:03:07,645
two overhead camshafts per bank,

83
00:03:07,645 --> 00:03:11,139
making six hundred seventy horsepower at eight

84
00:03:11,139 --> 00:03:13,266
thousand four hundred r p m,

85
00:03:13,266 --> 00:03:16,532
and four hundred sixty pound-feet of torque

