00:03:16,532 --> 00:03:18,811
at six thousand three hundred.

87
00:03:18,991 --> 00:03:21,801
The redline is eight thousand six hundred.

88
00:03:22,150 --> 00:03:25,203
That is twenty horsepower more than the

89
00:03:25,203 --> 00:03:28,569
previous Z06, which used a supercharged six

90
00:03:28,569 --> 00:03:30,057
point two liter V8.

91
00:03:30,237 --> 00:03:33,594
Chevrolet's new engine makes more power with

92
00:03:33,594 --> 00:03:37,180
less displacement and without forced induction.

93
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:40,555
Hagerty described it as the most powerful

94
00:03:40,555 --> 00:03:43,594
naturally aspirated production V8 ever.

95
00:03:43,944 --> 00:03:47,403
The Drive listed forged aluminum pistons,

96
00:03:47,403 --> 00:03:50,103
