136
00:05:18,242 --> 00:05:19,218
Think about that.

137
00:05:19,398 --> 00:05:22,522
The engineers behind America's sports car,

138
00:05:22,522 --> 00:05:25,573
the car that has competed against Ferrari

139
00:05:25,573 --> 00:05:27,359
